      "what_it_does": "Critic-free RL algorithm that uses binary rewards (proof verified = 1, else 0) without requiring a separate value network, using group-relative advantages computed across a batch of attempts on the same problem",
      "used_by": ["DeepSeek-Prover-V2", "Goedel-Prover-V2"],
      "could_be_applied_to": "Any RL setting with binary/sparse rewards and no natural value function — code generation with test suites, chemical property prediction with experimental validation, constraint satisfaction problems"
