      "what_it_does": "Periodically averages the current fine-tuned model weights with the base model weights to prevent diversity collapse during SFT/RL, preserving pass@N performance while still improving pass@1",
      "used_by": ["Goedel-Prover-V2"],
      "could_be_applied_to": "Any fine-tuning pipeline where output diversity matters — code generation (maintaining diverse solution strategies), creative writing, multi-solution optimization. Remarkably simple and practically free compared to architectural solutions like mixture-of-experts"
